{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/9150d717b85bcbd73b7e2d5fd0e90632.webp?t=1758603653\" width=378 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been activated by the Felsat Organization\u2014forced into abandoned research facilities that house unspeakable terrors, from the shadows.... and the ones that lurk in your fragile mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task: recover sensitive data hidden inside marked objects before the horrors inside tear you apart, or your sanity unravels completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/4b89604064770d4e86f5971f5867eee5.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/4b89604064770d4e86f5971f5867eee5.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select your class and build your character<i> -\u00a0Choose between 4 unique classes with unique abilities and stats then build your character as you play</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brute -</strong> A class built around strength <strong>-\u00a0</strong>destroy the clutter in your way with ease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thief -</strong> Speed and Agility<strong> -</strong> Run, jump, and slide your way through the facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haggler -</strong> Money Maker - Cheaper buys and the ability to access the shop remotely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journeyman -</strong> Jack of all trades and master of none - The perfect class to carve out the playstyle during your run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/393a24bfc335643b82d09c42ff68966a.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/393a24bfc335643b82d09c42ff68966a.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a desperate descent into procedurally generated dungeons where nothing stays the same for long. Time is limited\u2014you have only <strong>five days</strong> to complete your objective. The deeper you go, the more your mind fractures, twisting reality until you can no longer trust what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is inevitable, but not meaningless. Death, madness, and repetition feed into a larger cycle of growth. Survive, adapt, and carve your own path forward\u2014if you can keep your grip on reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/e6923ee92808dbdb4d580f3b60c4b75c.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/e6923ee92808dbdb4d580f3b60c4b75c.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities hide from you, watch you, hide as other objects, or pretend to be your friend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are not friendly. Use all the tools you're given to fend them off... or run for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/f7b50f92c5a41e6eee700ae524374b27.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/f7b50f92c5a41e6eee700ae524374b27.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities aren't the only threat, traps can take you out very quickly..... And if you let your mind slip, you might find that to be the biggest threat of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/5e54e71ea75b3e1feb945288256a53df.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/5e54e71ea75b3e1feb945288256a53df.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999430?t=1758603653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/58274c17a954b142342b412bfa10a72e48b04713/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758603653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/e215cc1a63c3eb3ce42fe5016035e77a56673e00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758603653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/e215cc1a63c3eb3ce42fe5016035e77a56673e00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758603653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of violence where if the player dies, they can be decapitated or dismembered."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/9150d717b85bcbd73b7e2d5fd0e90632.webp?t=1758603653\" width=378 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been activated by the Felsat Organization\u2014forced into abandoned research facilities that house unspeakable terrors, from the shadows.... and the ones that lurk in your fragile mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task: recover sensitive data hidden inside marked objects before the horrors inside tear you apart, or your sanity unravels completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/4b89604064770d4e86f5971f5867eee5.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/4b89604064770d4e86f5971f5867eee5.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select your class and build your character<i> -\u00a0Choose between 4 unique classes with unique abilities and stats then build your character as you play</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brute -</strong> A class built around strength <strong>-\u00a0</strong>destroy the clutter in your way with ease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thief -</strong> Speed and Agility<strong> -</strong> Run, jump, and slide your way through the facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haggler -</strong> Money Maker - Cheaper buys and the ability to access the shop remotely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journeyman -</strong> Jack of all trades and master of none - The perfect class to carve out the playstyle during your run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/393a24bfc335643b82d09c42ff68966a.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/393a24bfc335643b82d09c42ff68966a.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a desperate descent into procedurally generated dungeons where nothing stays the same for long. Time is limited\u2014you have only <strong>five days</strong> to complete your objective. The deeper you go, the more your mind fractures, twisting reality until you can no longer trust what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is inevitable, but not meaningless. Death, madness, and repetition feed into a larger cycle of growth. Survive, adapt, and carve your own path forward\u2014if you can keep your grip on reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/e6923ee92808dbdb4d580f3b60c4b75c.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/e6923ee92808dbdb4d580f3b60c4b75c.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities hide from you, watch you, hide as other objects, or pretend to be your friend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are not friendly. Use all the tools you're given to fend them off... or run for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/f7b50f92c5a41e6eee700ae524374b27.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/f7b50f92c5a41e6eee700ae524374b27.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities aren't the only threat, traps can take you out very quickly..... And if you let your mind slip, you might find that to be the biggest threat of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/5e54e71ea75b3e1feb945288256a53df.poster.avif?t=1758603653\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/extras/5e54e71ea75b3e1feb945288256a53df.webm?t=1758603653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Piemaster37"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999430/f77ccb7d208ea3aceb1cbb878791740770bc699d/header.jpg?t=1758603653","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Piemaster37. All rights reserved.","linux_requ